1104:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_usart.c **** *\*\          - USART_FLAG_NELOSE   Received Data NE Error Discard Flag
1105:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_usart.c **** *\*\          - USART_FLAG_PELOSE   Received Data PE Error Discard Flag
